finding('should fix','7 screen','diagnosis: fasting glucose 7.0 mmol/L or more','The numerical threshold is right, but the screen presents a single result as a diagnosis without a clinical/repeat-testing condition. It is not needed to teach pathogenesis.','Remove this incidental diagnostic tag, or say "one diagnostic criterion: fasting plasma glucose >=7.0 mmol/L, normally confirmed by repeat testing". Prefer removing the tag and its competing reading load.'),
